Hi Adeline,

This function is part of the genomation package, and the code can be found here: https://github.com/BIMSBbioinfo/genomation/blob/fa285d07802273fe3cf1a0b2a7b4de034a34544d/R/readAnnotate.R#L871
You could try to compare the output of your code with our implementation and see if there are any differences. I would be happy to hear about any issues you might find or suggestions on how we can improve it.

Best,
Alex

